  "notes": "Activity precedes delivery, so the email cannot be established as the origin of the scan; nothing else is malicious. Classification: inconclusive. Evidence labels: 'observed' = readable in an artifact; 'inferred' = derived/correlated. iocs/timeline/relationships files are the reference reconstruction (hide for blind tests). All hosts and addresses use reserved example domains, all IPs are documentation ranges, all activity is synthetic."
